Package: nbadatar
Title: Load NBA Play-by-Play, Possessions and Lineups Data
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Ramiro", "Bentes", , "ramirobentes@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides functions to download and load modified NBA play-by-play,
    possession and lineup data covering 30 seasons, for both the regular
    season and the playoffs. Data is hosted as 'Parquet' files on 'GitHub' and
    updated daily during the season.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
